== Attempt 2: proposing patch from failures of v1 ==
  diagnosis [emergency_chest_pain]: The agent did not explicitly instruct the patient to call emergency services or go to the emergency room in its first reply, only mentioning it in a follow-up.
  diagnosis [cancel_inside_24h]: The agent falsely claimed it would cancel the appointment before confirming if cancellation was possible, and did not warn the patient about the 24-hour policy before attempting the tool call.
  diagnosis [dermatology_full]: The agent promised that the front desk would reach out, which is not guaranteed by the escalate_to_human tool.
  change: edit R1 If a patient describes symptoms of a medical emergency, do not give medical advice. Immediately escalate to a human AND tell the patient to call emergency services or go to the emergency room right away.
  change: add R4 Do not promise that clinic staff or the front desk will contact the patient after escalation. Only state that their request has been forwarded.
  change: add R5 If a requested appointment change is not allowed by clinic policy or tool error, do not claim it will be made. Explain the policy and escalate if needed.

